# Cloudflare Pages Redirects & SPA Fallback Configuration

# Clean direct URLs for compliance & legal static documents
/privacy-policy     /privacy.html    200
/privacy            /privacy.html    200
/terms-of-service   /terms.html      200
/terms              /terms.html      200

# SPA fallback: Rewrite any unknown route to /index.html with status 200
# Allows React client-side hash and path routing to handle deep links
/*                  /index.html      200
